# ============================================================
# MEDICARE — Environment Variables Template
# ============================================================
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your real values.
# NEVER commit your ".env" file to version control.
# The ".env" file is already listed in .gitignore.
# ============================================================

# ----------------------------------------------------------
# Google Maps Platform API Key
# ----------------------------------------------------------
# Required for live nearby healthcare facility search.
# Without this, MEDICARE uses the local offline facility
# directory as a fallback — all other features remain active.
#
# Setup steps:
#   1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
#   2. Create or select a project.
#   3. Enable these APIs:
#        - Places API (New)
#        - Geocoding API
#   4. Create an API key under APIs & Services → Credentials.
#   5. Restrict the key:
#        - Application restrictions: Windows apps or IP addresses
#        - API restrictions: Select only "Places API" and "Geocoding API"
#   6. Enable billing on your project (Places API requires it; free tier applies).
#   7. Paste the key below and rename this file to ".env".
#
# Security note:
#   This key is a CLIENT-SIDE key. Even with restrictions, treat
#   it as sensitive. Do not log it, share it, or embed it in code.
#   Rotate it immediately if compromised.
#
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# ----------------------------------------------------------
# (Optional) Future integrations
# ----------------------------------------------------------
# Uncomment and populate if additional services are added.
# GOOGLE_GEOCODING_API_KEY=your_geocoding_key_here
